%
(DMC2 SCRIPT 1)
(DMC2 EFFECTS axis-motion;digital-output;coordinate-state;external-command)
(DMC2 REQUIRES running-session;estop-clear;machine-on;interpreter-idle;all-homed)
(DMC2 RECOVERY abort-task)
(DMC2 END)
(Automatic rim trace: first edge, descend below contact, full-diameter backoff, local contour.)
(Physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
o<rim-preview> if [#<_task> EQ 0]
    (PREVIEW,stop)
    M2
o<rim-preview> endif
o<rim-valid> if [#<_hal[axisui.rim-parameters-valid]> NE 1]
    (ABORT,Correct the settings in Scripts before Run. Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<rim-valid> endif
(X increasing: physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X; decreasing: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X.)
#<arg0> = [2]
#<arg1> = [#<_hal[axisui.rim-drop-mm]>]
#<arg2> = [#<_hal[axisui.rim-grid-mm]>]
#<arg3> = [#<_hal[axisui.rim-resolution-mm]>]
#<arg4> = [#<_hal[axisui.rim-usable-reach-mm]>]
#<arg5> = [#<_hal[axisui.rim-reach-reserve-mm]>]
#<arg6> = [#<_hal[axisui.rim-trace-depth-mm]>]
#<arg7> = [0]
(Backoff comes from the retained probe diameter; arg7 is a legacy field.)
o<mapper-run> call [#<arg0>] [#<arg1>] [#<arg2>] [#<arg3>] [#<arg4>] [#<arg5>] [#<arg6>] [#<arg7>]
M2
%
